---
# Domestic node. It is the only ingress that stays reachable from inside the
# restricted network, so it fronts every chain leaving the country — and it
# never egresses on a user's behalf except on its own test chain.
ansible_host: 203.0.113.10

# Names angie terminates TLS for, and that the certificate covers. The first
# is this node's primary: chains and subscription links address it by that
# name. The apex is an alias — it round-robins across several nodes, so it is
# fine for the site and useless for a chain, which needs to land on a node it
# names.
#
# Read across plays through hostvars, so it belongs in the inventory rather
# than in a role's defaults.
vpn_domains:
  - v0.example.com
  - example.com
